# shell: tracker
# lang: fr
# The file commands come from the catalogue: a right-click in French
# opens a French context menu -- Open, Get info, Move to Trash and the
# rest, each by its French name, accents and all.
wait 10
click-row 1
wait 2
press-row 1 3
wait 2
release-row 1 3
wait 4
expect-menu Ouvrir|Modifier la requête|Ouvrir avec…|Informations|Modifier le nom|Dupliquer|Mettre à la corbeille||Déplacer vers|Copier vers|Créer un lien|Couper|Copier|Coller||Identifier|Extensions|
quit
